    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d623">

                <pb facs="0918" n="1426" sameAs="frus:frus1948v05p2/pg1426"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB/9–2848: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Embassy in the United Kingdom
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-09-28T15:00:00-05:00">September 28,
                            1948—3 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3790. Louis [<hi rendition="#italic">Lewis</hi>] Jones from McClintock. Confirm
                    to Wright my remarks to him Sep 23 concerning desire Dept that, in light
                    existing circumstances, top priority be accorded treatment Palestine problem
                    Paris GA. [McClintock.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lovett</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
